<title>HONG KONG: Hopewell interim net up 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Hopewell interim net up 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.5  vs  10.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     6.0  vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			  502.14  vs  466.42</p>
